{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Hear</b> — This word is exceptional in our language, for according to our understanding it should say 'all of you,' and similarly 'all of you return' and 'come now,' and also Micayahu the prophet said concerning Ahab: <span class=\"he\">שמעו עמים כולם</span> ('hear, all you peoples'). And by way of reasoning, Micah is not Micayahu son of Imlah, for many generations are between them." "<b>Give heed</b> — by way of parable, for her fullness is those who stand upon her." "<b>For a witness</b> — for I warned you and made known to you."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:32.741355040Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}